<title>USA: Ensco International up after earnings.</title>
<headline>Ensco International up after earnings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Contract driller and marine transport company Ensco International Inc shares rose 1-7/8 to 64-1/2 in early trade after the company reported second quarter earnings above analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The company reported second quarter earnings per share of $0.74 against $0.34 a year ago and this compares with analyst forecasts of $0.68 for the quarter. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
